---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Base title="about">
  <PageHeader eyebrow="behind the desk" title="about" intro="the teacher, the idea, and where everything on this site belongs." />

  <div class="about-layout mt-10">
    <div class="about-story">
      <section>
        <p class="about-section__number">01 / the teacher</p>
        <h2>relaxed on purpose<span>.</span></h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
        I'm Mr. Auch. I teach US History, Hidden History, and Beyond the Scoreboard. My room is relaxed on purpose.
        We joke around, chase strange questions, argue over what really happened, and somehow cover a ridiculous amount
        of history along the way.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
        The goal is not to make school feel more like school. It is to make the story interesting enough that you want
        to know what happens next. If you leave class laughing and accidentally remember why Reconstruction failed or
        how television changed sports, that works for me.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <p class="about-section__number">02 / the site</p>
        <h2>one useful home base<span>.</span></h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
        The Desk keeps the slides, games, source packets, class tools, and odd detours in one place. Google Classroom
        still handles assignments, grades, and turn-ins.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-sidebar" aria-label="Contact and quick answers">
      <section class="about-contact">
        <p class="about-section__number">contact</p>
        <h2>find me where class lives<span>.</span></h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Students and families can reach me through Google Classroom or my school email.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-faq">
        <p class="about-section__number">quick answers</p>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
        <details class="surface-link rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 open:border-accent">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none font-semibold lowercase">are grades posted here?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">No. Grades, assignments, and turn-ins are in Google Classroom.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="surface-link rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 open:border-accent">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none font-semibold lowercase">is hidden history a conspiracy-theory class?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            It is a class about finding out which extraordinary stories are documented, which fall apart, and which
            remain honestly unproven. Watergate, MKUltra, and COINTELPRO sit beside famous hoaxes for a reason.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="surface-link rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 open:border-accent">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer select-none font-semibold lowercase">where are the latest updates?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft">
            Check <a href="/announcements/" class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4">announcements</a> for the
            newest additions to the site.
          </p>
        </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about-layout {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .about-story {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .about-story section,
    .about-contact,
    .about-faq {
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 1.8rem);
      border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-ink) 14%, transparent);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.86);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 46px -42px rgb(23 23 28 / 0.75);
    }

    .about-story section:first-child {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-soft) 55%, white), white 55%);
    }

    .about-section__number {
      color: var(--color-accent-dark);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 4vw, 2rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      line-height: 1.08;
      text-transform: lowercase;
    }

    h2 span {
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .about-story p:not(.about-section__number) {
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    .about-sidebar {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 760px) {
      .about-layout {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(17rem, 0.75fr);
      }

      .about-sidebar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 6rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
